[\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(15\), \(\(-3\)/2\)]\),\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(6.1\), \
\(\(-3\)/2\)]\)]\>\""}]}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"LogLogPlot", "[", 
          RowBox[{
